C
      DOUBLE PRECISION xk1, xk2, xk3, xk4, xk5, xk6, xk7, xk8, xk9, xk10
      DOUBLE PRECISION xk11, xk12, xk13, xk14, xkw, xk21, xk22, xk31, 
     +                 xk32, xk41
